# 1. Obtener la lista de tareas (GET)
# GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### 1. Crear una nueva tarea (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": 1
}

### 2. Tarea invalida
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"titulo":""}

### 3. Peticion a tarea sin existir
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/99999

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Terminar la práctica",
  "estado": "EN PROGRESO"
}
